Description:The opponent has cast Smallpox. You are at 20 life and control Grizzly Bears and two Forests; your hand is Obstinate Baloth and Colossal Dreadmaw. End the turn with Obstinate Baloth on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-885c810bc3a5c196 | A spell's instructions happen in order (CR 608.2c): an Obstinate Baloth discarded to Smallpox enters before the sacrifice step, so it could be sacrificed, and Grizzly Bears can be sacrificed instead
